question:
In a certain code language,
‘fit sat cut’ means ‘fast running river’;
‘cut hot lot’ means ‘river is deep’;
and ‘hot fit rat’ means ‘fast is clean’.
Which word in that language means ‘deep’?

question_hi:
एक निश्चित कूट भाषा में,
‘fit sat cut’ का अर्थ ‘fast running river’ है;
‘cut hot lot’ का अर्थ ‘river is deep’ है;
और ‘hot fit rat’ का अर्थ ‘fast is clean’ है।
उस भाषा में किस शब्द का अर्थ ‘deep’ है?
